433:   * a ROUND TRIP cannot observe an accepted WRITE at +0x00 or +0x08 (the prelude rewrites CRIME_REV and CRIME_CONTROL
434:     on every access) -- but the write's EFFECTS can, and are rowed: from the PROM-probe window an accepted write
435:     REDIRECTS the pc (revP sw pc, revP sd pc), and at CONTROL the arm's effects (sw08 halts, sw08 msg ctl at 4 bytes;
