462:     lvalue (`d->use_fb', `flag_for_128MB'), which holds one value per machine and is 0 on this probe's -M 64 non-graphics
463:     ip32 -- a graphics O2 (use_fb = 1) would see `odata = d->use_fb' answer 1.  Unrowable on one machine, like the
