48:     arm stores it (:275-295), but the prelude re-forces CONTROL = ENDIANESS at EVERY access (:231), so the stored value
49:     is visible to nothing.  The CONTROL arm tests DOG (:361) and clears it (:362), tests HARD_RESET (:364), clears
50:     ENDIANESS (:375) and prints iff the residue is nonzero (:377-379).  For 0x0200 the residue is 0: nothing prints and
51:     nothing stops.
