36: ("if a body-tested-partition mutant escapes -> L2, IN as the pair") applies to H_noresetclear on its own words --
37: HARD_RESET is a TESTED bit of the arm.  ENDIANESS is not tested (cleared unconditionally, never branched on), so by
38: the pinned meaning of "tests" it is outside the generating set; whether its residue cell is floor or clause (e) is a
39: RULE QUESTION for the adjudicators.  And it is the SECOND consecutive pass finding a residue-of-a-clear cell in one arm
40: (repair 14's adjudication found DOG; this pass found HARD_RESET), which is the repair-chain amendment's trigger for a
41: CLASS CLOSURE of all three clears in one diff.
